  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-title-prefix",
      "text": "DSH 插件：**给每条会话标题加上所属项目名前缀**。\n\nDSH plugin: **prefixes every session title with the name of its workspace / project.**\n\n[中文](#中文) · [English](#english)"
    },
    {
      "section": "中文",
      "text": "```\n原标题：  修复登录超时\n改后：    my-app · 修复登录超时\n```\n\n兜底标题和模型生成的标题都会加前缀；你手动改过的标题不加。\n\n适合**会话列表单列平铺展示**时使用：不必点开每条会话，就能看出它属于哪个 workspace / 项目。\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dotdance/dsh-title-prefix/main/assets/sidebar-session-list.png\" width=\"320\" alt=\"侧栏会话列表：每条标题都带项目名前缀\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-title-prefix\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "```\nBefore:  修复登录超时\nAfter:   my-app · 修复登录超时\n```\n\nBoth fallback titles and model-generated titles get the prefix; titles you renamed yourself are left unchanged.\n\nUseful when the **session list is a single flat column**: you can tell which workspace / project each conversation belongs to without opening it."
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dotdance/dsh-title-prefix/main/assets/sidebar-session-list.png\" width=\"320\" alt=\"Session list in the sidebar: every title carries its project prefix\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-title-prefix\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
